-|Scope | _Here you should enter scope, according to VKontakte  [documentation](https://vk.com/dev/permissions)_ for example __email__ |
-|OAuth2 Access Token Profile Service Parameter name| access_token|
-|Proxy URL| _[Your OpenAM URL]/oauth2c/OAuthProxy.jsp_ for example: https://openam.example.com/openam/oauth2c/OAuthProxy.jsp |
